{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蕭秀香（三姐）曾在 TVB 節目《女人必學100道菜》中，公開了煎豬扒的秘訣。只要掌握關鍵步驟，就能輕鬆煎出外脆內嫩、多汁又不柴的「不敗煎豬扒」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0da718fc-b45a-445a-a3a8-ab84fc4c670c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026wjXa8bxxaH1790763315.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0da718fc-b45a-445a-a3a8-ab84fc4c670c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9da5b6b5-3d24-4e45-9088-3a6f2b78e2c6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Ip8QwwdGRw1790763315.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9da5b6b5-3d24-4e45-9088-3a6f2b78e2c6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食材準備</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不敗煎豬扒製作步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2 大成功貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04